  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Golla Tirupalu vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 20 June, 2022 Author: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Bench: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Criminal Petition Nos.1405 and 1406 of 2020 Common Order:",
    "facts": "Therefore, both these Criminal Petitions are being heard and disposed of by this common order.",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioners would submit that these are covered matters in view of the earlier common order passed by this Court in Crl.P.No.3731 of 2018 and batch, dated 27.08.2018, Crl.P.No.5421 of 2019 and batch, dated 18.12.2019 and Crl.P.No.2966 of 2021 and batch, dated 28.12.2021, whereby this Court has [LEAKAGE_MASK] several F.I.Rs. registered for the similar offences based on identical facts.",
